{"id":"1975358c159b50db","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-resolution-feasible-interpolation.md","title":"Feasible Interpolation for Resolution","display":"thm-resolution-feasible-interpolation — Feasible Interpolation for Resolution","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-resolution-feasible-interpolation","aliases":["28-thm-resolution-feasible-interpolation"],"display":"thm-resolution-feasible-interpolation — Feasible Interpolation for Resolution","depends_on":["[[28-df-resolution]]","[[28-df-cnf]]","[[28-df-literal]]","[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 15.4; conservative proof-size parameter","source_printed_pages":"312–313","source_pdf_pages":"338–339","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"statement-checked-proof-not-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-resolution-feasible-interpolation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-resolution-feasible-interpolation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-resolution-feasible-interpolation — Feasible Interpolation for Resolution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fced6234cc12ca5b\" href=\"?note=fced6234cc12ca5b\" title=\"28-df-resolution\">28-df-resolution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" href=\"?note=c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" title=\"28-df-cnf\">28-df-cnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f3bec18052244e5d\" href=\"?note=f3bec18052244e5d\" title=\"28-df-literal\">28-df-literal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 15.4; conservative proof-size parameter"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"312–313"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"338–339"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked-proof-not-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{CNF},\\operatorname{ResRef}\">\\(\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{CNF},\\operatorname{ResRef}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fced6234cc12ca5b\" href=\"?note=fced6234cc12ca5b\" title=\"28-df-resolution\">28-df-resolution</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" href=\"?note=c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" title=\"28-df-cnf\">28-df-cnf</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f3bec18052244e5d\" href=\"?note=f3bec18052244e5d\" title=\"28-df-literal\">28-df-literal</a>。固定三列两两互异且列间不交的变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x_i),(y_i),(z_i)\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}^{\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\">\\((x_i),(y_i),(z_i)\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}^{\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg v\">\\(\\neg v\\)</span> 为否定文字。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{k,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C\">\\(\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{k,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(C)\">\\(V(C)\\)</span> 为顶点集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 为有限变量集到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 的赋值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=(C_1,\\ldots,C_s)\">\\(P=(C_1,\\ldots,C_s)\\)</span> 是有限非空子句序列。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n,b\\in\\{0,1\\}^m,c\\in\\{0,1\\}^k\">\\(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n,b\\in\\{0,1\\}^m,c\\in\\{0,1\\}^k\\)</span>；空乘积为1。下式同时给变量范围、CNF求值、证明总书写量及合法反驳的索引集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X_n\\coloneqq\\{x_i:i\\in[n]\\},\\qquad Y_m\\coloneqq\\{y_i:i\\in[m]\\},\\qquad Z_k\\coloneqq\\{z_i:i\\in[k]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X_n\\coloneqq\\{x_i:i\\in[n]\\},\\qquad Y_m\\coloneqq\\{y_i:i\\in[m]\\},\\qquad Z_k\\coloneqq\\{z_i:i\\in[k]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X_n\\cup Y_m\\cup Z_k\\subseteq\\mathrm{PropVar}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X_n\\cup Y_m\\cup Z_k\\subseteq\\mathrm{PropVar}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNF}[W]\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{CNF}:\\forall D\\in A\\ \\forall\\ell\\in D\\ [\\ell\\in W\\lor\\exists v\\in W\\ \\ell=\\neg v]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CNF}[W]\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{CNF}:\\forall D\\in A\\ \\forall\\ell\\in D\\ [\\ell\\in W\\lor\\exists v\\in W\\ \\ell=\\neg v]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e_\\sigma(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\sigma(v)&amp;\\ell=v\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma),\\\\1-\\sigma(v)&amp;\\ell=\\neg v,\\ v\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma),\\end{cases}\\qquad E(A,\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\prod_{D\\in A}\\left(1-\\prod_{\\ell\\in D}(1-e_\\sigma(\\ell))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e_\\sigma(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\sigma(v)&amp;\\ell=v\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma),\\\\1-\\sigma(v)&amp;\\ell=\\neg v,\\ v\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma),\\end{cases}\\qquad E(A,\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\prod_{D\\in A}\\left(1-\\prod_{\\ell\\in D}(1-e_\\sigma(\\ell))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma^X_{a,c}\\coloneqq\\{(x_i,a_i):i\\in[n]\\}\\cup\\{(z_i,c_i):i\\in[k]\\},\\qquad\\sigma^Y_{b,c}\\coloneqq\\{(y_i,b_i):i\\in[m]\\}\\cup\\{(z_i,c_i):i\\in[k]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma^X_{a,c}\\coloneqq\\{(x_i,a_i):i\\in[n]\\}\\cup\\{(z_i,c_i):i\\in[k]\\},\\qquad\\sigma^Y_{b,c}\\coloneqq\\{(y_i,b_i):i\\in[m]\\}\\cup\\{(z_i,c_i):i\\in[k]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S(P)\\coloneqq s+\\sum_{i=1}^s|C_i|,\\qquad\\mathcal C_k\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{k,1}:\\operatorname{BF}(C)\\},\\qquad\\mathcal J_{n,m,k}\\coloneqq\\{(A,B,P):A\\in\\mathrm{CNF}[X_n\\cup Z_k],\\ B\\in\\mathrm{CNF}[Y_m\\cup Z_k],\\ \\operatorname{ResRef}(A\\cup B,P)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S(P)\\coloneqq s+\\sum_{i=1}^s|C_i|,\\qquad\\mathcal C_k\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{k,1}:\\operatorname{BF}(C)\\},\\qquad\\mathcal J_{n,m,k}\\coloneqq\\{(A,B,P):A\\in\\mathrm{CNF}[X_n\\cup Z_k],\\ B\\in\\mathrm{CNF}[Y_m\\cup Z_k],\\ \\operatorname{ResRef}(A\\cup B,P)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\exists K\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\ \\forall n,m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall(A,B,P)\\in\\mathcal J_{n,m,k}\\ \\exists C\\in\\mathcal C_k\\quad&amp;|V(C)|\\le k+K(S(P)+1)^2\\\\\n\\land\\ \\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\\ \\forall c\\in\\{0,1\\}^k\\quad&amp;[((1-E(A,\\sigma^X_{a,c}))\\lor\\operatorname{out}_C(c)_1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land((1-E(B,\\sigma^Y_{b,c}))\\lor(1-\\operatorname{out}_C(c)_1))=1].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\exists K\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\ \\forall n,m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall(A,B,P)\\in\\mathcal J_{n,m,k}\\ \\exists C\\in\\mathcal C_k\\quad&amp;|V(C)|\\le k+K(S(P)+1)^2\\\\\n\\land\\ \\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\\ \\forall c\\in\\{0,1\\}^k\\quad&amp;[((1-E(A,\\sigma^X_{a,c}))\\lor\\operatorname{out}_C(c)_1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land((1-E(B,\\sigma^Y_{b,c}))\\lor(1-\\operatorname{out}_C(c)_1))=1].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>使用教材Theorem15.4的O(S²)规模结论，并将S取为总书写量，从而不依赖“size”只计行数还是文字数的歧义。本条只记录普通电路部分；单调强化另需共享变量的极性条件。未完整核验插值变换及复杂度证明，故禁止作为已核验证明依赖。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 15.4; conservative proof-size parameter；印刷页 312–313；PDF 页 338–339。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第15章的 Feasible Interpolation for Resolution，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n<p>量词复核：全称反驳参数P显式受ResRef(A∪B,P)条件约束；不是对任意不满足反驳条件的公式对声称插值。A、B范围仍为Hypothesis绑定的各自变量域CNF。</p>\n<p>最终量词与签名核对：绝对常数K置于所有输入维度、公式和合法反驳之前；S(P)按当前反驳重新计算。通过显式集合J限制反驳与变量域，避免固定S或固定有效P假设被内层量词重新绑定后丢失。</p>\n<p>输入规模边界：本目录BoolCirc要求列出全部k个输入顶点，包括未使用共享变量，因此总顶点数界显式加k；教材O(S²)对应运算门部分，不能在有任意多未使用输入时直接用于总顶点数。A含空子句、B为空CNF和短反驳的退化例已核对，新增k项覆盖该情形。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-resolution","status":"resolved","id":"fced6234cc12ca5b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-resolution]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"c8f19b1793fdfb6a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"f3bec18052244e5d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-literal]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-resolution","status":"resolved","id":"fced6234cc12ca5b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{CNF},\\operatorname{ResRef}$ 见 [[28-df-resolution]]、[[28-df-cnf]]、[[28-df-literal]]。固定三列两两互异且列间不交的变量 $(x_i),(y_i),(z_i)\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}^{\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}$；$\\neg v$ 为否定文字。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"c8f19b1793fdfb6a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{CNF},\\operatorname{ResRef}$ 见 [[28-df-resolution]]、[[28-df-cnf]]、[[28-df-literal]]。固定三列两两互异且列间不交的变量 $(x_i),(y_i),(z_i)\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}^{\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}$；$\\neg v$ 为否定文字。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"f3bec18052244e5d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{CNF},\\operatorname{ResRef}$ 见 [[28-df-resolution]]、[[28-df-cnf]]、[[28-df-literal]]。固定三列两两互异且列间不交的变量 $(x_i),(y_i),(z_i)\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}^{\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}$；$\\neg v$ 为否定文字。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{k,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]；$V(C)$ 为顶点集。$\\sigma$ 为有限变量集到 $\\{0,1\\}$ 的赋值；$P=(C_1,\\ldots,C_s)$ 是有限非空子句序列。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{CNF},\\operatorname{ResRef}","display":false},{"tex":"(x_i),(y_i),(z_i)\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}^{\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{k,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C","display":false},{"tex":"V(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P=(C_1,\\ldots,C_s)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n,b\\in\\{0,1\\}^m,c\\in\\{0,1\\}^k","display":false},{"tex":"X_n\\coloneqq\\{x_i:i\\in[n]\\},\\qquad Y_m\\coloneqq\\{y_i:i\\in[m]\\},\\qquad Z_k\\coloneqq\\{z_i:i\\in[k]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"X_n\\cup Y_m\\cup Z_k\\subseteq\\mathrm{PropVar}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNF}[W]\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{CNF}:\\forall D\\in A\\ \\forall\\ell\\in D\\ [\\ell\\in W\\lor\\exists v\\in W\\ \\ell=\\neg v]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"e_\\sigma(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\sigma(v)&\\ell=v\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma),\\\\1-\\sigma(v)&\\ell=\\neg v,\\ v\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma),\\end{cases}\\qquad E(A,\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\prod_{D\\in A}\\left(1-\\prod_{\\ell\\in D}(1-e_\\sigma(\\ell))\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma^X_{a,c}\\coloneqq\\{(x_i,a_i):i\\in[n]\\}\\cup\\{(z_i,c_i):i\\in[k]\\},\\qquad\\sigma^Y_{b,c}\\coloneqq\\{(y_i,b_i):i\\in[m]\\}\\cup\\{(z_i,c_i):i\\in[k]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"S(P)\\coloneqq s+\\sum_{i=1}^s|C_i|,\\qquad\\mathcal C_k\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{k,1}:\\operatorname{BF}(C)\\},\\qquad\\mathcal J_{n,m,k}\\coloneqq\\{(A,B,P):A\\in\\mathrm{CNF}[X_n\\cup Z_k],\\ B\\in\\mathrm{CNF}[Y_m\\cup Z_k],\\ \\operatorname{ResRef}(A\\cup B,P)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\exists K\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\ \\forall n,m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall(A,B,P)\\in\\mathcal J_{n,m,k}\\ \\exists C\\in\\mathcal C_k\\quad&|V(C)|\\le k+K(S(P)+1)^2\\\\\n\\land\\ \\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\\ \\forall c\\in\\{0,1\\}^k\\quad&[((1-E(A,\\sigma^X_{a,c}))\\lor\\operatorname{out}_C(c)_1)\\\\\n&\\land((1-E(B,\\sigma^Y_{b,c}))\\lor(1-\\operatorname{out}_C(c)_1))=1].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4335,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-353","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-frege-system]]、[[28-thm-craig-propositional-interpolation]]、[[28-thm-resolution-feasible-interpolation]]。"}],"outgoing":["fced6234cc12ca5b","c8f19b1793fdfb6a","f3bec18052244e5d","7776a98a623ada8d"]}